      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            There is something particularly beautiful about turning the most
            ordinary bathroom objects into part of the room. The rich amber
            glass gives this simple soap dish depth and warmth without making
            it feel overly decorative.
          </p>

          <p>
            We especially like it against pale stone, warm ceramics and natural
            wood, where the amber tone creates a subtle contrast. Pair it with
            a beautifully made bar of soap and soft neutral towels for an easy,
            collected bathroom look.
          </p>

          <p>
            Its compact 13.5 × 9.5 cm footprint also makes it an easy addition
            to smaller basins and bathroom shelves.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Simple care for everyday use</h2>

        <p>
          Wipe or rinse gently with warm water and a soft cloth. Avoid abrasive
          cleaners or rough sponges that could dull the painted amber finish
          over time.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
