            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Neutral Towels</h3>
            <p>
              Ivory, oatmeal and soft beige textiles keep the palette calm
              and understated.
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="styling-card">
